# sk-walls -- W6-03-01: a lone wall segment must NOT keep a defeated house
# alive. Walls are overlays once placed in the original ([OverlayTypes]
# 3=GAWALL, 27=NAWALL) and Insignificant=yes, so the ShortGame last-building
# rule never counts them. Kill house 1, give it one NAWALL, require WON.
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
wait 600
cheat kill_house 1
cheat place NAWALL 1 building 0:GACNST +8 +0
wait 2
assert buildings(1) == 1
assert units(1) == 0
assert defeated(1) == 1
until 60 world_outcome == WON
until 900 outcome == WON
end
